And what triggers all the negative emotions,

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:36.000
I think the husband is coming from his own side,

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.400
that's what triggers it.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.560
BSKYED PA NYID

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:39.960
that's it and nothing else.

