because the word MA in Tibetan, although it can mean negative. It also means mom.

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:46.920
Sometimes they glue it onto the word for foundation to say like the mother, the mother foundation or something.

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:54.720
So some people translate this negative and they'll get in trouble. It's not MA YIN, it's GZHI MA, YIN.

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:58.120
So, okay, YIN TSUL DANG.

