now I got to know you and now I love, I actually
kind of like you. So it's called Getting to Know You.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.200
NYON MONGS PA'I GNYEN PO BSTEN SKABS,

00:23:54.760 --> 00:24:00.480
When you are trying to apply the antidote to your negative emotions

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:03.200
This BSTEN means applying an antidoteBISTEN.

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:06.440
DANG PO NYON MONGS PA SKYER BCUG

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:08.200
He says, he's very funny,

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:12.520
Pabongka Rinpoche says, "I'll teach you a trick, Okay?"

