I can see him leaning over, and don't forget he's talking to a couple of thousand people without a microphone

00:24:20.360 --> 00:24:22.400
for like eight hours

00:24:23.280 --> 00:24:30.280
Like unbelievable and I can just see him leaning over and sotto, sotto voice?

